{"user": "g2? there's not much scope for white to do damage after that", "user_ts": "2026-08-18T21:34:37.772016+00:00", "assistant": "Careful: after **g2**, White can likely play **h1**. From **h1** down-left, White would bracket your new **g2** with **f3** white, so the corner becomes available.\n\nA corner like **h1** is permanent, so even if g2 flips a lot now, it may hand White a stable corner. What other legal move avoids giving White a corner immediately?", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-18T21:34:46.849043+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-18T21:34:48.168405+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Negative Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Negative Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt", "Negative Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt"]}}
{"user": "is h1 better than a1", "user_ts": "2026-08-18T21:35:31.455206+00:00", "assistant": "For Black, **neither h1 nor a1 is legal right now**.\n\nAs corners, they\u2019re both permanent and valuable. But **h1 is the immediate danger after g2**: it can let White take that corner next. So judge your move by: \u201cDoes this give White a corner right away?\u201d", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-18T21:35:41.749159+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-18T21:35:42.500626+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Prompt": 1, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Prompt": 0.3333333333333333, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Hint"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction"]}}
{"user": "so the key is to prevent white getting a corner?", "user_ts": "2026-08-18T21:36:12.257227+00:00", "assistant": "Yes\u2014**preventing White from getting a corner is a big key**, because corners can\u2019t be flipped back.\n\nBut it\u2019s not the only key: also ask, **after my move, how many legal moves does White have, and are they damaging?** In this position, be especially wary of moves that open **h1** or **a1** for White.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-18T21:36:16.278987+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-18T21:36:17.350085+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 2, "Common Ground Question": 2, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 0.6666666666666666, "Common Ground Question": 0.6666666666666666, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Local Justification": 1, "General Principle": 3, "Hint": 2, "Prompt": 2, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Local Justification": 0.3333333333333333, "General Principle": 1.0, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"]}}
